{"id":"wb-7-1927","name":"新疆第一口油井","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"新疆第一口油井","text":"新疆第一口油井（维吾尔老文字：شىنجاڭ 1-نېفىت قۇدۇقى，拉丁维吾尔文：Shinjang 1-nëfit quduqi）是新疆开掘的第一口油井，于清代末年发掘，是近代新疆石油工业兴起的标志。新疆第一口油井位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区克拉玛依市独山子区。\n新疆第一口油井是全国重点文物保护单位、石油石化行业中央企业工业文化遗产、国家工业遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%B0%E7%96%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A3%E6%B2%B9%E4%BA%95","revisionId":91828769,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91828769","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1a01c80964c22d408d3077a2.jpg","title":"新疆第一口油井.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%96%B0%E7%96%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A3%E6%B2%B9%E4%BA%95.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/%E6%96%B0%E7%96%86%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A3%E6%B2%B9%E4%BA%95.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​新疆第一口油井","width":320,"height":240}}